            "detailed_description": "For 3-8 Players and an Audience of thousands!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe team behind the hit party games YOU DON’T KNOW JACK, Fibbage, and Drawful presents Quiplash, the laugh-a-minute battle of wits and wittiness! Use your phone or tablet to answer simple prompts like “Something you’d be surprised to see a donkey do” or “The worst soup flavor: Cream of _____.” <br />\r\n<br />\r\nNo rules, no correct answers! Say whatever you want!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour answer is pitted against another player’s answer in a head-to-head clash of cleverness and comedy (or just “Which answer is least stupid?”). Other players – and even an Audience of people waiting to get in the next game – then vote for their favorite answer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nQuiplash is a go-to party game that everyone can play and enjoy!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNOTE: This game is a same-room multiplayer party game.<br />\r\nNOTE: This game is in English only.",
            "about_the_game": "For 3-8 Players and an Audience of thousands!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe team behind the hit party games YOU DON’T KNOW JACK, Fibbage, and Drawful presents Quiplash, the laugh-a-minute battle of wits and wittiness! Use your phone or tablet to answer simple prompts like “Something you’d be surprised to see a donkey do” or “The worst soup flavor: Cream of _____.” <br />\r\n<br />\r\nNo rules, no correct answers! Say whatever you want!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour answer is pitted against another player’s answer in a head-to-head clash of cleverness and comedy (or just “Which answer is least stupid?”). Other players – and even an Audience of people waiting to get in the next game – then vote for their favorite answer.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nQuiplash is a go-to party game that everyone can play and enjoy!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNOTE: This game is a same-room multiplayer party game.<br />\r\nNOTE: This game is in English only.",
